Description:
    Description:
        The worker pool generator creates the necessary configuration files for a new worker pool in the monolith.
        This includes Kubernetes deployment files, kustomize configurations and worker files to manage/deploy the worker pool in a specific environment.

Example:
    bin/rails generate worker_pool my-dedicated-worker

    This will create:
        modified:   config/kustomize/base/production/kustomization.yaml
        config/kubernetes/production/deployments/my-dedicated-worker.yaml
        config/kustomize/base/production/aqueduct/deployments/my-dedicated-worker.yaml
        config/resqued/github-my-dedicated-worker-kube.rb
